--- stdout
deedglass · the execution and accountability layer for AI agents

Usage  deedglass <command> [flags]

Setup
  init                Set up Deedglass in this directory          soon
  doctor              Check config, database and keys             soon
  serve               Run the API, the Gate and the Console       soon
  migrate             Apply or check database migrations                 up · status · verify
  config print        Show the effective config, secrets hidden
  version             Show the client and server versions
  keys                Manage seal keys                            soon   gen · rotate · list
  vault               Check or rotate the credential vault        soon   status · rotate
  completion          Print shell completion                      soon   zsh · bash · fish
Agents
  agent               Register and control agents                 soon   create · list · show · suspend · resume · stop · start
  agent keys          Manage an agent's API keys                  soon   create · list · roll · revoke
  agent intent        Manage an agent's signed-intent keys        soon   keygen · add · list · remove · mode
  org                 Create orgs and keys; stop or start all     soon   create · login-link · keys · stop-all · start-all
Policies
  policy              Write, test and activate policies           soon   lint · fmt · test · push · activate · evaluate · replay · diff
Actions
  act                 Send a test action through the Gate         soon
  actions             Inspect actions                             soon   list · show · cancel
  approve · deny      Decide a pending approval                   soon
  approvals           List pending approvals                      soon   list · show
  undo                Preview or run an undo                      soon   preview · run
  webhooks            Send events to your endpoints               soon   create · list · test · delete
Deeds
  verify              Check deeds offline                         soon
  deeds               Browse and export deeds                     soon   list · show · export
  ledger              Check or prune the Ledger                   soon   check · prune
Connectors
  connector           Connect tools                               soon   create · list · show · test · types · credentials
  connector postgres  Prepare a Postgres database                 soon   init · check
  connector gmail     Authorize the Gmail connector               soon   authorize
  decoder             Inspect Postgres change readers             soon   status · drop
  slack manifest      Print the Slack app manifest                soon
MCP
  mcp                 Put the Gate in front of MCP servers        soon   wrap · serve · snippet
Insights
  insights            Usage, shadow results and anomalies         soon   stats · shadow · anomalies · detect · settings · suggestions · digest
Dev
  dev                 Local helpers                               soon   seed · fake-action · simulate · agent-script · mail-preview · sign-intent · stripe-fixtures

Global flags  --json · --server <url> · --api-key <key> · --org <id> · --no-color · -v
Run deedglass help <command> for details · https://docs.deedglass.com
